WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.789
It happened during the first landing on Izune!

2
00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:07.976
Did our kinsman agree to help the Orcs?

3
00:00:08.976 --> 00:00:13.648
Koll agreed to release Skulnar's spirit? Unbelievable!

4
00:00:14.648 --> 00:00:19.405
So that's how it all happened! Brus's blood helped find Isa...

5
00:00:20.405 --> 00:00:24.289
And yet he abandoned this oath. To save Isa!

6
00:00:25.289 --> 00:00:30.516
None of us could have imagined such a thing! Our lost brother!

7
00:00:31.516 --> 00:00:37.066
That's why no one could find Isa! The Thread Keepers hid it well.

8
00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:42.784
A sad story. It's a pity that this happened. But there was no other choice...

9
00:00:43.784 --> 00:00:48.377
It turns out that Koll Sharp... is your ancestor, Gerda.

10
00:00:49.377 --> 00:00:56.123
That's why there was always one Gibberling in our family.
A bond severed two centuries ago!

11
00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.873
Can we bring Isa back to the world?

12
00:01:00.873 --> 00:01:04.302
But at what cost? Skulnar will be free again!
